<title>NETHERLANDS: Generale raises Akzo Nobel to buy.</title>
<headline>Generale raises Akzo Nobel to buy.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Sept 25 research.</p>
<p>    Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>    Akzo Nobel	chemicals     198.90  Generale Bank</p>
<p>COMMENT: Buy (from Hold). Akzo's new antidepressant drug Remeron will contribute to results in 1997 while short term outlook improved because of better price developments. Therefore, we raised our 1997 estimates and dividend. Our 12-month price target is 220 guilders per share.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS	pvs	P/E     Dividend</p>
<p>    1995 (actual)	18.46		 10.8     7.00</p>
<p>    1996		   18.50		 10.8     7.00</p>
<p>    1997		   20.75  (19.50)     9.6     7.50</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
